__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"LEGAL_CONTACT",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return n}}),Object.defineProperty(e,"LEGAL_UPDATED",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return l}}),e.legalText=function(n,l){return('tr'===n?t:o)[l]};const n='contact@example.com',l='2026-11-14',t={privacy:{title:'Gizlilik Politikas\u0131',sections:[{h:'K\u0131saca',p:['LOOPI anlar\u0131n\u0131 kimlerin g\xf6rece\u011fini sen se\xe7ersin. Verini satmay\u0131z, reklam i\xe7in ba\u015fkalar\u0131yla payla\u015fmay\u0131z. Bu metin hangi bilgileri neden toplad\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z\u0131 ve bunlar\u0131 nas\u0131l kontrol edebilece\u011fini anlat\u0131r.']},{h:'Toplad\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z bilgiler',p:['Hesap: e-posta adresin ya da Apple/Google ile giri\u015fte payla\u015f\u0131lan temel bilgiler, ad\u0131n, kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131n, do\u011fum tarihin (ya\u015f s\u0131n\u0131r\u0131 ve 16-17 ya\u015f korumalar\u0131 i\xe7in).','Payla\u015ft\u0131klar\u0131n: anlar (foto\u011fraf, a\xe7\u0131klama, se\xe7ti\u011fin kitle), yorumlar, tepkiler, mesajlar, profil foto\u011fraf\u0131 ve kapak.','Konum: yaln\u0131zca bir ana konum eklemek istedi\u011finde ve izin verirsen. Arka planda konum toplamay\u0131z.','Cihaz ve kullan\u0131m: uygulaman\u0131n \xe7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131 ve g\xfcvenli\u011fi i\xe7in gerekli teknik bilgiler (uygulama s\xfcr\xfcm\xfc, hata kay\u0131tlar\u0131, bildirim anahtar\u0131).']},{h:'Neden kullan\u0131yoruz',p:['Hizmeti sunmak: ak\u0131\u015f, ke\u015ffet, harita, widget ve mesajla\u015fma.','Seni ve di\u011fer kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131 korumak: ya\u015f korumalar\u0131, engelleme, \u015fikayetlerin incelenmesi, k\xf6t\xfcye kullan\u0131m\u0131n \xf6nlenmesi.','Hizmeti geli\u015ftirmek: toplu ve kimli\u011fi belirlenemeyen istatistikler.']},{h:'Kimler g\xf6rebilir',p:["Bir an\u0131 yaln\u0131zca se\xe7ti\u011fin kitle g\xf6r\xfcr (arkada\u015flar, takip\xe7iler ya da herkes). Gizli profilin anlar\u0131 hi\xe7bir zaman herkese a\xe7\u0131lmaz. 16-17 ya\u015f\u0131ndaki kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n anlar\u0131 Ke\u015ffet'te g\xf6sterilmez ve tan\u0131mad\u0131klar\u0131 yeti\u015fkinlerle mesajla\u015famazlar.",'Engelledi\u011fin ki\u015filer seni g\xf6remez, sana mesaj atamaz.']},{h:'Saklama ve silme',p:['Bilgilerini hesab\u0131n a\xe7\u0131k oldu\u011fu s\xfcrece saklar\u0131z. Ayarlar \u2192 Hesab\u0131 sil ile hesab\u0131n\u0131 ve payla\u015ft\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131 kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak silebilirsin; yedeklerden en ge\xe7 30 g\xfcn i\xe7inde temizlenir. Yasal y\xfck\xfcml\xfcl\xfck gereken kay\u0131tlar (\xf6r. \u015fikayet incelemeleri) gerekli s\xfcre kadar tutulabilir.']},{h:'Haklar\u0131n',p:['Bilgilerine eri\u015fme, d\xfczeltme, silme, ta\u015f\u0131ma ve i\u015flenmesine itiraz etme hakk\u0131n var. Talepler i\xe7in a\u015fa\u011f\u0131daki adrese yaz; 30 g\xfcn i\xe7inde yan\u0131tlar\u0131z.']},{h:'\xc7ocuklar',p:['LOOPI 16 ya\u015f ve \xfczeri i\xe7indir. 16 ya\u015f\u0131ndan k\xfc\xe7\xfck oldu\u011funu \xf6\u011frendi\u011fimiz hesaplar\u0131 kapat\u0131r\u0131z.']},{h:'\u0130leti\u015fim',p:[`Sorular ve talepler: ${n}`]}]},terms:{title:'Kullan\u0131m Ko\u015fullar\u0131',sections:[{h:'Kabul',p:["LOOPI'yi kullanarak bu ko\u015fullar\u0131 kabul etmi\u015f olursun. Ko\u015fullar de\u011fi\u015firse uygulama i\xe7inde haber veririz."]},{h:'Ya\u015f',p:['Hesap a\xe7mak i\xe7in en az 16 ya\u015f\u0131nda olmal\u0131s\u0131n. Do\u011fum tarihini do\u011fru girmelisin.']},{h:'Hesab\u0131n',p:['Hesab\u0131n\u0131n g\xfcvenli\u011finden sen sorumlusun. Ba\u015fkas\u0131 ad\u0131na hesap a\xe7amaz, kullan\u0131c\u0131 ad\u0131n\u0131 taklit ama\xe7l\u0131 kullanamazs\u0131n.']},{h:'Payla\u015f\u0131m kurallar\u0131',p:['\u015eunlar\u0131 payla\u015fmak yasakt\u0131r: \xe7\u0131plakl\u0131k ve cinsel i\xe7erik, \u015fiddet ve tehdit, taciz ve zorbal\u0131k, nefret s\xf6ylemi, ba\u015fkalar\u0131n\u0131n \xf6zel bilgileri, yasa d\u0131\u015f\u0131 \xfcr\xfcn ve hizmetler, spam.','Re\u015fit olmayanlar\u0131 i\xe7eren her t\xfcrl\xfc uygunsuz i\xe7erik derhal kald\u0131r\u0131l\u0131r ve yetkililere bildirilir.']},{h:'\u0130\xe7eri\u011fin',p:['Payla\u015ft\u0131klar\u0131n\u0131n sahibi sensin. Hizmeti sunabilmemiz i\xe7in (g\xf6stermek, saklamak, se\xe7ti\u011fin kitleye iletmek) bize s\u0131n\u0131rl\u0131, devredilemez bir kullan\u0131m izni verirsin. \u0130\xe7eri\u011fini sildi\u011finde bu izin sona erer.']},{h:'\u015eikayet ve yapt\u0131r\u0131mlar',p:['Kurallara ayk\u0131r\u0131 i\xe7erikleri kald\u0131rabilir, hesaplar\u0131 ge\xe7ici ya da kal\u0131c\u0131 olarak kapatabiliriz. Kararlara itiraz i\xe7in bize yazabilirsin.']},{h:'Sorumluluk',p:['Hizmeti "oldu\u011fu gibi" sunar\u0131z. Kullan\u0131c\u0131lar\u0131n payla\u015ft\u0131klar\u0131ndan onlar\u0131n kendisi sorumludur.']},{h:'\u0130leti\u015fim',p:[n]}]}},o={privacy:{title:'Privacy Policy',sections:[{h:'In short',p:['On LOOPI you choose who sees your moments. We do not sell your data or share it with others for advertising. This page explains what we collect, why, and how you stay in control.']},{h:'What we collect',p:['Account: your email or the basic details shared by Apple/Google sign-in, your name, username and date of birth (for the age limit and the 16-17 protections).','What you share: moments (photo, caption, audience), comments, reactions, messages, profile photo and cover.','Location: only when you choose to tag a moment and allow it. We never collect location in the background.','Device and usage: technical details needed to run and secure the app (app version, crash logs, push token).']},{h:'Why we use it',p:['To provide the service: feed, discover, map, widget and messaging.','To keep people safe: age protections, blocking, reviewing reports, preventing abuse.','To improve the service: aggregated, non-identifying statistics.']},{h:'Who can see what',p:['A moment is only shown to the audience you pick (friends, followers or everyone). A private profile never posts publicly. Moments by 16-17 year olds are not shown in Discover, and they cannot message adults they do not know.','People you block cannot see you or message you.']},{h:'Keeping and deleting',p:['We keep your data while your account is open. Settings \u2192 Delete account removes your account and what you shared for good; backups are cleared within 30 days. Records we must keep by law (e.g. report reviews) may be kept as long as required.']},{h:'Your rights',p:['You can access, correct, delete and export your data and object to its use. Write to us below; we reply within 30 days.']},{h:'Children',p:['LOOPI is for people aged 16 and over. We close accounts we learn belong to anyone younger.']},{h:'Contact',p:[`Questions and requests: ${n}`]}]},terms:{title:'Terms of Use',sections:[{h:'Agreement',p:['By using LOOPI you agree to these terms. If they change, we will let you know in the app.']},{h:'Age',p:['You must be at least 16 to create an account and give your real date of birth.']},{h:'Your account',p:['You are responsible for keeping your account secure. Do not create accounts for others or impersonate anyone.']},{h:'Sharing rules',p:["Not allowed: nudity and sexual content, violence and threats, harassment and bullying, hate speech, other people's private information, illegal goods or services, spam.",'Any inappropriate content involving minors is removed immediately and reported to the authorities.']},{h:'Your content',p:['You own what you share. You give us a limited, non-transferable licence to show, store and deliver it to the audience you choose. It ends when you delete the content.']},{h:'Reports and enforcement',p:['We may remove content that breaks the rules and suspend or close accounts. Write to us to appeal a decision.']},{h:'Liability',p:['The service is provided "as is". People are responsible for what they share.']},{h:'Contact',p:[n]}]}}},805,[]);